---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import OutcomeLabel from '../../components/OutcomeLabel.astro';
import { studyById } from '../../lib/publication';
import { cases, previews } from '../../lib/evidence';
---
<SiteLayout title="Research" description="Six complete Ardor research cases, from market hypothesis to documented decision, and a catalog of 114 scoped records." type="index">
  <header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">The research</span><h1>Questions worth testing.<br />Decisions worth keeping.</h1><p class="lede">Six cases trace a plausible mechanism through information timing, execution and statistical evidence. The Indian-equity evidence supports no certified or live strategy.</p></header>
  <div class="archive-callout" style="margin-bottom:40px"><div><span class="eyebrow">Inside Ardor</span><h2 style="font-size:30px;margin-top:12px">Inspect the system behind the cases.</h2><p>Traceable observations and separate comparison/certification contracts, explained with exact source and bounded synthetic inputs.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/engineering/">Explore Inside Ardor</a></div>
  <div class="two-columns" style="margin-bottom:45px"><div><h2 style="font-size:27px">Enter through any question</h2><p class="small">All six cases below retain their complete reviewed narrative, controlling decisions and evidence. No case is a prerequisite.</p></div><div><h2 style="font-size:27px">Follow the signal mechanics</h2><p class="small">The existing Momentum v2 model uses synthetic prices, five exact source excerpts and a separate recorded verdict. <a href="/research/walkthrough/">Open the walkthrough</a>.</p></div></div>
  {cases.map((c,i)=><article class="case-row"><span class="case-number">0{i+1}</span><div><h2 style="font-size:30px;margin-bottom:12px"><a href={`/research/cases/${c.slug}/`}>{c.title}</a></h2><div class="outcomes">{c.outcomes.map(s=><OutcomeLabel status={s}/>)}</div></div><div><p><strong>{studyById.get(c.id)!.question}</strong></p><p>{studyById.get(c.id)!.researchObject}</p><p>{c.summary}</p></div></article>)}
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="other-directions"><h2 id="other-directions">Other research directions</h2><p>Four directions at different stages: infrastructure, dated analysis, design and rights-blocked preparation. These are not four additional completed investigations.</p><ul>{previews.map(p=><li><a href={`/research/previews/#${p.id}`}>{p.title}</a><p class="small">{p.maturity}</p></li>)}</ul><a href="/research/previews/">What exists and what remains in each direction</a></section>
  <div class="archive-callout" style="margin-bottom:60px"><div><h2 style="font-size:29px;margin-bottom:12px">Beyond the featured cases</h2><p>The 114-record catalog includes overlapping designs, versions and preview paths. It is a coverage inventory, not an independent-strategy count.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/research/catalog/">Browse the catalog</a></div>
</SiteLayout>
